  <section class="case-section restored-chapter" id="portrait">
    <header class="restored-section-heading"><span class="restored-number">06 / IDENTITY RECONSTRUCTION</span><h2>{t('浪漫化：将真实个体转化为审美符号','Romanticisation: the person becomes an aesthetic symbol')}</h2></header>
    <p>{t('用户进入交互装置后，系统接收前序体验中累积的身份信息、疾病标签、动作数据与身体反馈，并将其转译为可计算的视觉参数。装置通过逐步限制感知输入强化沉浸体验，使这些数据持续介入数字形象的生成过程。','The installation receives accumulated identity, labels, movements, and bodily feedback, translating them into visual parameters. Progressively restricted sensory input deepens immersion while data shapes the emerging digital identity.')}</p>
    <div class="restored-feature"><Figure node="26:758" image="imgRectangle19" alt={t('身份重构阶段的交互座椅装置','The interactive chair for identity reconstruction')} lang={lang} contained/><div><h3>{t('数据如何进入最终形象','How data enters the final portrait')}</h3><div class="restored-loop"><div><span>{t('数据输入','INPUT')}</span><p>{t('身份信息 / 疾病标签 / 动作数据 / 身体反馈','Identity / illness labels / movement / bodily feedback')}</p></div><div><span>{t('系统转译','TRANSLATION')}</span><p>{t('数据映射 / 参数提取 / 权重计算 / 视觉生成','Data mapping / parameter extraction / weighting / visual generation')}</p></div><div><span>{t('输出基础','OUTPUT')}</span><p>{t('轮廓建立 / 特征生成 / 形态变化 / 身份重构','Contours / features / form changes / identity reconstruction')}</p></div></div></div></div>
